Richie?

00:35:44.270 --> 00:35:44.950
Is that you, Richie?

00:35:49.270 --> 00:35:49.950
Come on, Richie.

00:35:50.330 --> 00:35:50.830
Come on out.

00:35:50.870 --> 00:35:51.930
I know you're in there, Richie.

00:35:53.190 --> 00:35:54.250
Come on out, Richie.

00:36:31.950 --> 00:36:32.010
Thank you.

00:37:19.260 --> 00:37:19.720
just like that.

00:37:30.190 --> 00:37:30.430
Thank you.

00:39:04.380 --> 00:39:27.780
He loves me not. He loves. He loves me not. He loves. As if I didn't know.

00:39:32.590 --> 00:39:34.050
Oh, T.P., where are you?

00:39:36.820 --> 00:39:39.020
And then he said he'd be back in ten minutes and left.

00:39:39.180 --> 00:39:42.500
It's been close to 45, and that's not like T.P., you know that, Dave.

00:39:42.740 --> 00:39:46.560
Yeah, I know. This happens at least twice a year.

00:39:47.200 --> 00:39:51.000
Last year, it took us about three hours to track down a kid who made a left instead of a right

00:39:51.000 --> 00:39:52.460
and wound up in the North Fork.

00:39:52.640 --> 00:39:53.860
That was in broad daylight.

00:39:55.520 --> 00:39:56.940
Betsy, I'm surprised at you.

00:39:57.200 --> 00:39:59.230
I didn't know you were such a worrier.

00:39:59.430 --> 00:39:59.970
Why this train?

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:08.280
look in your eyes well you two are gonna laugh but as tp was leaving i saw something by the side

00:40:08.280 --> 00:40:13.490
of the house i it was big i couldn't make any features because of the shadows okay betsy i

00:40:13.490 --> 00:40:18.830
get your point i'll go looking for him no need to make up any more stories for the dramatic effect

00:40:18.830 --> 00:40:24.100
i'm not making up any stories what happened to this shadow for the next time i looked up

00:40:25.760 --> 00:40:29.940
gone okay i'm leaving look see how fast i'm moving they don't make fun

00:40:30.680 --> 00:40:35.660
I'm sorry. Don't worry so much.

00:40:36.480 --> 00:40:37.860
I'll find him one, two, three.

00:40:38.860 --> 00:40:42.720
Keep her company till we get back, okay?

00:40:42.900 --> 00:40:56.330
I saw something out there. I did.

00:40:59.130 --> 00:40:59.970
At least I think I did.

