00:51:30.160 --> 00:51:33.560
Alone? I've got five kids to look after. Who's alone?

00:51:34.830 --> 00:51:36.530
Only get back as soon as you can.

00:51:36.750 --> 00:51:39.760
I don't want Max to find everybody gone. He's funny that way.

00:51:40.320 --> 00:51:41.840
We'll gather the group and come right back.

00:51:42.120 --> 00:51:43.160
Good. That's what I want to hear.

00:52:11.680 --> 00:52:12.160
TP?

00:52:15.560 --> 00:52:16.020
Dave?

00:52:19.960 --> 00:52:20.400
Richie?

00:53:07.800 --> 00:53:17.800
Daddy? Richie?

00:53:36.010 --> 00:53:58.880
