It's a pick up.

00:57:05.840 --> 00:57:06.500
Yeah, I see it.

00:57:07.260 --> 00:57:08.160
She's in the woods already.

00:57:10.590 --> 00:57:12.010
Look, the campfire area is that way.

00:57:12.580 --> 00:57:14.520
