00:57:16.720 --> 00:57:17.500
Be careful.

00:57:18.070 --> 00:57:18.450
You too.

00:57:18.710 --> 00:57:19.170
Are you ready?

00:57:19.620 --> 00:57:21.100
Ready as I'll ever be.

